{"parse": {"title": "10TH-03", "pageid": 105722, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/10TH-02\" title=\"10TH-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">10TH-03</span><a href=\"/wiki/10TH-04\" title=\"10TH-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">10TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">03</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.86.B0.E4.B8.AD.E8.8B.A6.E6.97.85\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"冰中苦旅\">冰中苦旅</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 冰中苦旅</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">An Icy Road</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-left: 16px; margin-bottom: -5px;\"><span class=\"item-link mode-middle mode-bonus\" data-itemid=\"1/220102\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><div class=\"item-bonus-probability star-5\"><span>首通</span></div><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%9D%A2%E8%A7%81%E5%9C%B0%E6%AF%8D\" title=\"面见地母\"><img alt=\"Bgequip5.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/100px-Bgequip5.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/150px-Bgequip5.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/200px-Bgequip5.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%9D%A2%E8%A7%81%E5%9C%B0%E6%AF%8D\" title=\"面见地母\"><img alt=\"面见地母\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/Item-220102.png/100px-Item-220102.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/Item-220102.png/150px-Item-220102.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/Item-220102.png/200px-Item-220102.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span><div class=\"item-middle-count\">1</div></span></span><span>&#8204;</span></span></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>此<span class=\"color-value\"></span>地<span class=\"color-value\"></span>封<span class=\"color-value\"></span>冻<span class=\"color-value\"></span>着<span class=\"color-value\"></span>所<span class=\"color-value\"></span>有<span class=\"color-value\"></span>答<span class=\"color-value\"></span>案<span class=\"color-value\"></span>—<span class=\"color-value\"></span>—<span class=\"color-value\"></span>他<span class=\"color-value\"></span>们<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>她<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>你<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 11003</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>真正的恐怖发生在进入腹地的第三天，那一天，我们在白日看到了极光。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan\"><img alt=\"2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/Cg-2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan.png/600px-Cg-2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/Cg-2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan.png/900px-Cg-2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/Cg-2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>太阳耀斑伴随着日冕物质抛射，即便是在朗朗白日中，极光都闪耀得几乎能烧瞎人眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>弗里莱提出渎神假设，她认为这次不正常的太阳运动是造物主发出的告诫，禁止我们继续深入。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但考特却并没有放弃。他认为我们辛苦多日，用厚雪砖垒起的防风墙就是为了抵御所有未知的苦难。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>可没有人意识到，真正的恐怖，来自脚下的深渊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-525001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-525001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-525001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">队友Ⅰ：</div><div>六分仪的测算准确无误，只要我们一直沿着这个方向进发……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-525001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-525001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-525001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">队友Ⅰ：</div><div>——唔、呜呜呜、唔！唔啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊——！！！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>第五天，埃德掉队了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan2\"><img alt=\"2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/Cg-2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan2.png/600px-Cg-2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/Cg-2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan2.png/900px-Cg-2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/Cg-2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan2.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-525101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-525101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-525101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">队友Ⅱ：</div><div>现在情况紧急，一部分人的工作重点需要转移到重筑防风墙上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-525101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-525101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-525101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">队友Ⅱ：</div><div>其他人专注修理通讯设备，尽早摆脱电磁干扰——把那些研究计划先放下！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-525101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-525101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-525101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">队友Ⅱ：</div><div>……恶、恶魔……魔鬼……哈哈、哈哈哈！啊啊啊啊——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>第七天，出现了第二名牺牲者。考特的离开让我们陷入了更糟糕的处境……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_bg_shibimigong\"><img alt=\"2_8_bg_shibimigong\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png/600px-Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png/900px-Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-525201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-525201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-525201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">队友Ⅲ：</div><div>这鬼地方终于向我们露出了它的爪牙，我从一开始就反对这么深入腹地，我们没有足够的经验——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-525201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-525201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-525201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">队友Ⅲ：</div><div>再见了各位，我脑中的声音已经无法割舍，与我融为了一体……我会带走它……哈哈，我会亲自带走它！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_bg_shibimigong\"><img alt=\"2_8_bg_shibimigong\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png/600px-Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png/900px-Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡的日记：</div><div>第十天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡的日记：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\">第十五天。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡的日记：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:111%\">第二十三天。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>第三十天，只剩我和弗里莱。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_bg_shibimigong\"><img alt=\"2_8_bg_shibimigong\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png/600px-Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png/900px-Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-524301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-524301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-524301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">队友Ⅳ：</div><div>没关系，不用担心，任何一条渔船都可以看到我们的求救信号，你只需要往回走，不要管我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-524301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-524301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-524301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">队友Ⅳ：</div><div>给，这是我最爱的奈普顿巧克力，它能让你多暖一阵子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>探险家合上她的日记本。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_bg_kekaozhan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_bg_kekaozhan\"><img alt=\"2_8_bg_kekaozhan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Cg-2_8_bg_kekaozhan.png/600px-Cg-2_8_bg_kekaozhan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Cg-2_8_bg_kekaozhan.png/900px-Cg-2_8_bg_kekaozhan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Cg-2_8_bg_kekaozhan.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_bg_kekaozhan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>这就是为什么我不想让你们进入南极腹地……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>我甚至、甚至希望你们最好尽快离开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>我了解了……原来这就是你的恐惧和顾虑……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>但相信我，我们会留心自身的安全。所以哪怕是一份大概的地图，对于我们来说也是至关……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>好，我们明白了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>——司辰？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>请收下这台卫星定位系统，不需多时救援就会抵达。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>但由于时间紧迫，我们必须先行离开。请恕我们失陪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>……为什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>为什么即使我已经这么警告过了，你们仍然要去南极腹地？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我们有必须这么做的理由。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>抬腿跨过门槛，呼啸的风雪砸在外衣衣角。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>等……等一下！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>幸存的探险家对着来访者的背影大喊，发泄一般倾泻着长久积累的惊慌与恐惧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>这片冰洲是活的！是有生命的，它会吃人——！这不是危言耸听！你们根本无法想象腹地的恐怖！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>即便成功逃脱也会精神崩溃，就像、就像……我的祖父罗夫一样——！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>向雪原离去的背影似乎放缓了些许步伐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>总、总而言之，你们不能走……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>至少为了你们自己的安全着想，不能再前进了——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>沉默中，喘息在天地间显得异常明晰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>片刻的思索后，来访者的脚步缓缓调转而来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>罗夫·阿蒙森……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我听过这个名字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>——什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>伟大的人类探险家。他的研究帮助发展了许多神秘学的应用技巧，无数神秘学家受益于此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>你的家族相信造物主留下的古老未知，热爱一切神秘学相关的事物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>诺谛卡低下头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>我们、我们真的这么有名气吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>阿蒙森家族走出了许多探险家，这种纯粹而简单的热忱甚至被写进了神秘学家学校的教科书里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>诺谛卡惊讶地瞪大了眼睛，脸颊也因寒冷与激动而变得更红。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>你会出现在南极，一定也是和你的家人们一样，有着想要追寻的东西吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我猜，这就是即使在南极经历了诸多不幸，你也依然不愿离开的理由。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>我、我没有不愿意离开！我每天都祈祷着地母带我离开这个鬼地方……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>这个科考站离海岸很近，你有无数种方式引起来往船只的注意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我们也是一样的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>——我们要找一个人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>探险家不解地瞪大了眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>什么……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一声叹息，回荡在小小的科考站内。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……你知道重塑之手吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>黑暗的窟窖内，一个巨型法阵被鲜血与莎草燃尽后的粉尘刻印在地上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>吼狮之尾，置于法阵的顶部。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><i>千百万潮水，皆遵循潮汐奔流</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>圣甲虫双翼，置于法阵最左端。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><i>以亵渎不洁的姿态，玷污天幕</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>承载着魂声的心灵贝壳，镶嵌在头颅遗骨上，置于法阵最右端。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><i>破除枷锁者，主宰一切的复苏之母</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>从叛军者手中获得的黑色焦土，放置在圣像之上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>以受反噬的炼金术士所炼制的不老泉浇祭。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><i>于今降下，至高福祉</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻的传道者站在祭坛边缘，遥望向远方的阴影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她所期盼的身影穿过了狭长的甬道，踏入祭坛窖室内。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"516012.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/HeadIconSmall-516012.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-516012.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"516012.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/HeadIconSmall-516012.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-516012.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/HeadIconSmall-516012.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-516012.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">传道者·苏菲亚：</div><div>一如谕中，你抵达了这里。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_at_fangche1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_at_fangche1\"><img alt=\"2_8_at_fangche1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/Cg-2_8_at_fangche1.png/600px-Cg-2_8_at_fangche1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/Cg-2_8_at_fangche1.png/900px-Cg-2_8_at_fangche1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/Cg-2_8_at_fangche1.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_at_fangche1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>目盲的女士，一手端着一杯豪麻汁，一手执着一束把森，赤足走来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>最终，她停在了法阵空缺的唯一一角上，补全了最后的图形。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"516013.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-516013.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-516013.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"516013.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-516013.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-516013.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-516013.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-516013.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">传道者·苏菲亚：</div><div>仪式的准备已经来到了最后的阶段。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"516013.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-516013.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-516013.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"516013.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-516013.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-516013.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-516013.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-516013.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">传道者·苏菲亚：</div><div>阿尔卡纳女士，我们的秘之教诲者已通过六音步诗向我传递祂最终的启示和神谕——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"516001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-516001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-516001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"516001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-516001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-516001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-516001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-516001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">传道者·苏菲亚：</div><div>目盲的来客，将代为开启这一伟大的仪式。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>黑袍的信徒们向着目盲者屈膝，匍匐，持续吟诵着。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_at_fangche1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_at_fangche1\"><img alt=\"2_8_at_fangche1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/Cg-2_8_at_fangche1.png/600px-Cg-2_8_at_fangche1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/Cg-2_8_at_fangche1.png/900px-Cg-2_8_at_fangche1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/Cg-2_8_at_fangche1.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_at_fangche1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>目盲者虚空的目光仿佛穿越无尽时间，最终落在法阵的中央。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一架金色的纺车静立于此，同她无声对望。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "10TH-03"}}